id: pm-57ir3b
title: "GH-752: list results claim completeness while unreadable items are omitted"
description: "Make list-family and SDK query results fail closed or expose structured unreadable-item incompleteness, and report decoder compatibility evidence without misattributing environment drift to item corruption."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: context,github,integrity,sdk,storage
